  {t="C", seg=1, q={1516,6394,794}, names={"Call of Earth","Thazz'ril's Pick","Burning Blade Medallion"}, text="The cave at the north end of the valley, behind the Vile Familiars. Felstalkers roam around and inside the cave and drop the hooves often. Inside, Thazz'ril's Pick glows on the ground in the chamber with the waterfalls; Yarrog Baneshadow (level 5) waits at the far end with the Medallion. Clear the imps around him first; if he starts casting, interrupt with Earth Shock, and heal between fights", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=44.0, y=53.9},
