  {t="C", seg=2, q={825,818}, names={"From The Wreckage....","A Solvent Spirit"}, text="The Gnomish Toolboxes lie in the sunken wreckage in the shallow water off the coast east of Razor Hill and Tiragarde Keep (61-65, 42-61). Swim out, loot 3, and come up for air between them. This stretch of coast is also full of Makrura (crab-men) and Pygmy Surf Crawlers: kill them here for 4 Intact Makrura Eyes and 8 Crawler Mucus, because the beach further south has only a few", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=62.5, y=50.0},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={818}, names={"A Solvent Spirit"}, text="Walk south along the shore to Master Vornal in Sen'jin Village", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=55.9, y=74.4, path={{55.4,51.0},{54.6,68.7},{56.2,70.8}}},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={786}, names={"Thwarting Kolkar Aggression"}, text="Kolkar Crag, the centaur valley just west of Sen'jin: burn the three Attack Plans (east end ~49.8,81.3, middle ~47.7,77.3, west end ~46.2,78.9). If a centaur runs at low health, Earthbind Totem slows it. Warlord Kolkanis (9) is a rare that is not always up: if you meet him, fight him alone", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=48.0, y=79.0},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99123}, names={"Lost in the Shadows"}, text="Pal'juh is hiding at the west end of the crag, near the third Attack Plan", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.3, y=78.6},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99123}, names={"Lost in the Shadows"}, text="Escort Pal'juh out of the crag. Clear the centaurs near her first, then stay close and kill whatever attacks her. If she dies, wait for her to come back and take the quest again", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.3, y=78.6},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={786}, names={"Thwarting Kolkar Aggression"}, text="Lar Prowltusk, west side of Sen'jin", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=54.2, y=73.3, path={{50.2,78.3},{52.6,73.2}}},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99123}, names={"Lost in the Shadows"}, text="Master Vornal", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=55.9, y=74.5},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={97223}, names={"Bloodtalon Matriarch"}, text="Swim east from the Sen'jin beach to the northern Echo Isle. Kill the Durotar Tigers and Taillasher raptors (6-8) around the Bloodtalon Matriarch one at a time, loot the Taillasher Egg nests on the ground and keep any Tiger Furs. Then pull her alone at full health and mana: she hits harder than the other raptors, so drop Stoneskin Totem and keep Healing Wave ready. Loot her eggs. These kills should make you level 8 before the trolls", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=68.5, y=71.5},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={808,826,97225}, names={"Minshina's Skull","Zalazane","Forgotten Loa Idols"}, text="Swim south to the largest of the Echo Isles. Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls and pick up 8 Forgotten Loa Idols lying around the island. Zalazane (10) and Minshina's skull are in the circle of power at the south end (67.5, 87.8). The trolls stand in groups: pull one at a time, Earth Shock the Voodoo Trolls' casts, Stoneskin Totem when two attack. Clear the trolls around Zalazane, then fight him at full health and mana. Kill the tigers on this island too", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=67.2, y=85.5},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={815,817}, names={"Break a Few Eggs","Practical Prey"}, text="On the swim back west to Sen'jin, finish the 3 Taillasher Eggs and 4 Durotar Tiger Furs on the west side of the isles (tigers and egg nests at 59-61, 78-91). Only about one tiger in three drops a fur", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=60.3, y=81.5},
