  {t="T", seg=2, q={99048}, names={"A Missing Hand"}, text="Heglan Shadeeye's wrecked hut is east of Razor Hill, just north of Tiragarde Keep", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=58.6, y=45.6},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99049}, names={"Threat from Below"}, zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=58.6, y=45.6},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99049}, names={"Threat from Below"}, text="Search the wrecked camp around Heglan's hut for the Orcish Dagger, the Banner Scrap and the Broken Bone Trident; they lie on the ground close by", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=58.6, y=45.6},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99049}, names={"Threat from Below"}, text="Back to Orgnil Soulscar in Razor Hill", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.2, y=43.1},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99051}, names={"Threat from Below"}, text="Keep this one: the naga scouts are on the north coast, which the next segment visits", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.2, y=43.1},
  {t="L", seg=2, lvl=10, text="Not level 10 yet? Go back to the Razormane Grounds and kill quilboars until you are. The next segment starts with Call of Fire and Conscript of the Horde, which both need level 10", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=43.0, y=39.0},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=3, text="Swart: learn your level 10 spells (Flame Shock, Strength of Earth Totem, Flametongue Weapon)", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=54.4, y=42.6},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={2983}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Also from Swart. Take only this Call of Fire: the copies in Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff and Mulgore are the same quest and you can only do one", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=54.4, y=42.6},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={840}, names={"Conscript of the Horde"}, text="Takrin Pathseeker, by the road on the west side of Razor Hill", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=50.8, y=43.6},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={816}, names={"Lost But Not Forgotten"}, text="Misha Tor'kren, at the lone farmstead north-west of Razor Hill. Kron's Amulet drops from the crocolisks along the Southfury River, which you walk along next", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=43.1, y=30.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={840}, names={"Conscript of the Horde"}, text="Head south-west back to the road and follow it west over the Southfury River bridge. Kargal Battlescar stands in Far Watch Post on the Barrens side", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=19.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={842}, names={"Crossroads Conscription"}, text="Keep it: you hand it in at the Crossroads at the start of the next segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=19.4},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={2983}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Kranal Fiss, about 600 yards west of Far Watch along the road", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.0, y=19.9},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={1524}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="He hands you the Torch of the Dormant Flame for Telf Joolam", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.0, y=19.9},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={1524}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Cross the bridge back into Durotar and follow the river south on its east bank, killing every Dreadmaw Crocolisk you pass (Kron's Amulet). Shortly before the river reaches the sea, a hidden trail climbs the cliffs on your left to the Shrine of the Dormant Flame. Telf Joolam waits at the top", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=38.5, y=59.0},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={1525}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Keep it. The Reagent Pouch drops from Burning Blade Cultists in Dustwind Cave later in this segment; the Fire Tar drops from Razormane casters in the Barrens in the next one", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=38.5, y=59.0},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={816}, names={"Lost But Not Forgotten"}, text="Go back down the trail and follow the river north, killing the crocs on the bank until Kron's Amulet drops (about 1 in 10 crocs). Healing Wave between pulls, they bite hard at your level", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=34.6, y=50.0},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={816}, names={"Lost But Not Forgotten"}, text="Misha Tor'kren. If the amulet still has not dropped, kill more crocs on the bank due west of her farm; give up and abandon the quest if it takes too long", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=43.1, y=30.2},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={834}, names={"Winds in the Desert"}, text="Rezlak, a goblin camped west of Drygulch Ravine, north-east of Misha's farm", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.4, y=22.9},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={834}, names={"Winds in the Desert"}, text="Pick up 5 Stolen Supply Sacks lying on the ground among the harpies south and south-east of Rezlak (47-51, 22-34). Kill the Dustwind harpies as you go: one of them can drop a Dull Storm Orb that starts a quest", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=49.2, y=29.7},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={834}, names={"Winds in the Desert"}, text="Rezlak", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.4, y=22.9},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={835}, names={"Securing the Lines"}, zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.4, y=22.9},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={835}, names={"Securing the Lines"}, text="Drygulch Ravine, just east: kill 12 Dustwind Savages and 8 Dustwind Storm Witches. Earth Shock the Storm Witches' lightning casts and keep Lightning Shield up", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.6, y=22.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={97281}, names={"A Simmering Storm"}, text="No Dull Storm Orb yet? Keep killing harpies in the ravine until one drops, then right-click it to start A Simmering Storm", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.0, y=22.5},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={1525}, obj={2}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Dustwind Cave, above the southern part of the ravine: kill Burning Blade Cultists inside until one drops a Reagent Pouch. They are casters standing close together: pull them one at a time, Earth Shock their casts, Stoneclaw Totem if two come at once", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.4, y=25.5},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={99051}, names={"Threat from Below"}, text="Go east to the coast: kill the naga scouts in their camps along the beach (56-60, 22-31) for 9 Naga Spinefins. A sea giant (elite, its own quest) walks the coast further north: stay away from it", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=59.0, y=25.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={835,97281}, names={"Securing the Lines","A Simmering Storm"}, text="Back west to Rezlak", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.4, y=22.9},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={97282}, names={"Stormy Potential"}, text="Keep it for after Orgrimmar: the thunder lizards live next to Fizzle's camp", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.4, y=22.9},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={812}, names={"Need for a Cure"}, text="Rhinag, north-west on the way to Orgrimmar. He needs an antidote that Kor'ghan in Orgrimmar makes", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=41.5, y=18.6},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={97246}, names={"Meal Appeal"}, text="Go north into Orgrimmar through the main gate. Thatog stands in the Valley of Strength. Orcs start the game knowing the Orgrimmar flight path, so there is no need to visit the wind rider master", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=55.6, y=72.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={97246}, names={"Meal Appeal"}, text="Borstan, the meat vendor at his firepit in the Drag", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=57.5, y=53.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={97249}, names={"Favorite Food"}, text="Migi's lunch: you deliver it behind Grommash Hold a bit later", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=57.5, y=53.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={813}, names={"Finding the Antidote"}, text="Kor'ghan, in the Cleft of Shadow (the sunken tunnel west of the Drag). He makes Rhinag's antidote from Venomtail Poison Sacs", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=47.2, y=53.6},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={97242}, names={"Yelmak's Medley"}, text="Kor'geld, in Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions at the north end of the Drag", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=56.1, y=34.4},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={97242}, names={"Yelmak's Medley"}, text="Valley of Honor, east: pick 2 Cattails and 4 Speargrass growing along the water. Blacksmiths and leatherworkers only: Ug'thok at the forge here and Kamari in the Drag offer Thunder Ridge quests that also need Rough Grinding Stones / Cured Light Hides; skip them otherwise", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=69.0, y=30.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={97242}, names={"Yelmak's Medley"}, text="Kor'geld", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=56.1, y=34.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={97275}, names={"Whuut's the Rush"}, text="Yelmak, in the same shop", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=56.7, y=33.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={97275}, names={"Whuut's the Rush"}, text="Whuut, a few steps away in the shop", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=55.8, y=33.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={831}, names={"The Admiral's Orders"}, text="Nazgrel, next to Thrall inside Grommash Hold in the Valley of Wisdom", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=32.3, y=35.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={5726}, names={"Hidden Enemies"}, text="Thrall. The Lieutenant's Insignia drops from Burning Blade Fanatics and Apprentices", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=31.8, y=37.9},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={97249}, names={"Favorite Food"}, text="Migi plays with his friends behind Grommash Hold", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=36.7, y=29.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={97326}, names={"Rocks to Rests"}, text="Thra, one of Migi's friends", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=38.7, y=28.2},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={97326}, names={"Rocks to Rests"}, text="Pick up 8 Smooth Boulders lying on the ground around the Valley of Wisdom", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=42.5, y=32.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={97326}, names={"Rocks to Rests"}, zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=38.8, y=28.3},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={806}, names={"Dark Storms"}, text="Leave by the main gate and go south to Thunder Ridge. Fizzle Darkstorm (12, goblin warlock) sits in the Burning Blade camp with Fanatics and Apprentices around him: pull those one at a time first (they can drop the Lieutenant's Insignia), then fight Fizzle at full health. Earth Shock his Shadow Bolts", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=42.1, y=26.7},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={97282,813}, names={"Stormy Potential","Finding the Antidote"}, text="Kill Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides in the gorge around Fizzle's camp for 5 Charged Thunder Lizard Organs, and Venomtail Scorpids (all over north-west Durotar, many near Rhinag) for 4 Venomtail Poison Sacs. Bonus: if Halikor's Hoof drops from a huge lizard, its quest goes to Kamari in the Drag", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=40.6, y=26.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={97282}, names={"Stormy Potential"}, text="Rezlak", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=46.4, y=22.9, path={{43.0,21.4}}},
  {t="H", seg=3, arg="Razor Hill", text="Hearth back to Razor Hill"},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={806}, names={"Dark Storms"}, text="Orgnil Soulscar", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.2, y=43.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={828}, names={"Margoz"}, zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.2, y=43.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={99051}, names={"Threat from Below"}, text="Also Orgnil. Do not take the sea giant quest he offers next (elite)", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=52.2, y=43.2},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=3, text="Swart, on the east side of town: if you are level 12 now, learn your level 12 spells (Healing Wave rank 3, Purge, Ancestral Spirit) before Skull Rock, where Gazz'uz is level 14. Not 12 yet? Skip this; you train in Orgrimmar later in this segment", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=54.4, y=42.6},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={828}, names={"Margoz"}, text="Margoz, at his camp north of Razor Hill, south of Skull Rock", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=56.4, y=20.0},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={827}, names={"Skull Rock"}, zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=56.4, y=20.0},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={827,5726}, names={"Skull Rock","Hidden Enemies"}, text="Skull Rock, the cave north of Margoz just east of Orgrimmar's gate: kill Burning Blade Fanatics and Apprentices for 6 Searing Collars. They also drop the Lieutenant's Insignia if you do not have it yet", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=53.0, y=9.5},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={832}, names={"Burning Shadows"}, text="Gazz'uz (14, warlock with a voidwalker) at the back of the cave. Rest to full first, drop Stoneclaw Totem to hold the voidwalker, kill Gazz'uz and Earth Shock his casts. His Eye of Burning Shadow starts this quest", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=51.9, y=9.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={827}, names={"Skull Rock"}, text="Margoz", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=56.4, y=20.0},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={829}, names={"Neeru Fireblade"}, zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=56.4, y=20.0},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={5726}, names={"Hidden Enemies"}, text="Into Orgrimmar: Thrall in Grommash Hold. If Halikor's Hoof dropped at Thunder Ridge, hand it to Kamari in the Drag (63.1, 44.9) on the way", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=31.8, y=37.9},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={5727}, names={"Hidden Enemies"}, zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=31.8, y=37.9},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={5727}, names={"Hidden Enemies"}, text="Neeru Fireblade in the Cleft of Shadow: show him the insignia and go through his dialogue", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=49.5, y=50.6},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={832,829}, names={"Burning Shadows","Neeru Fireblade"}, text="Neeru Fireblade, same visit. Do not take his Slaying the Beast: it is a Ragefire Chasm quest", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=49.5, y=50.6},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={809}, names={"Ak'Zeloth"}, zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=49.5, y=50.6},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={813}, names={"Finding the Antidote"}, text="Kor'ghan, a few steps away in the Cleft: you get the Venomtail Antidote", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=47.2, y=53.6},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={5727}, names={"Hidden Enemies"}, text="Back to Thrall. Do not take the next Hidden Enemies: it leads into Ragefire Chasm", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=31.9, y=37.9},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=3, text="Kardris Dreamseeker, Valley of Wisdom next to Grommash Hold: learn your level 12 spells if you did not at Swart", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=38.8, y=36.4},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={812}, names={"Need for a Cure"}, text="Out through the main gate and south-west to Rhinag with the antidote", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=41.5, y=18.6},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={809}, names={"Ak'Zeloth"}, text="Follow the road south and take the western fork over the Southfury River bridge to Far Watch Post: Ak'Zeloth", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=20.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={924}, names={"The Demon Seed"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=20.1},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={924}, names={"The Demon Seed"}, text="Take a Flawed Power Stone from Ak'Zeloth's table and go straight to Dreadmist Peak, no detours: it burns out after a while. Follow the road west past Kranal Fiss and turn north where it forks; the peak is on your left. Climb it from the north side and use the stone at the Altar of Fire on top. The Burning Blade on the slope will chase you: kill them fast or drop Earthbind Totem and keep going. Then walk south to the Crossroads (next segment)", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=48.0, y=19.1},
  {t="G", seg=4, text="Come down Dreadmist Peak and walk south-east to the Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.0, y=29.9},
  {t="S", seg=4, arg="Crossroads", text="Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind at the Crossroads inn", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.0, y=29.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={6365}, names={"Meats to Orgrimmar"}, text="Zargh, at his cooking fire next to the inn", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.6, y=29.8},
  {t="F", seg=4, arg="Crossroads", text="Devrak, the wind rider master on the tower", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.3},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={6365}, names={"Meats to Orgrimmar"}, text="Devrak", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={6384}, names={"Ride to Orgrimmar"}, text="Keep Zargh's Meats: you fly to Orgrimmar at the end of this segment and deliver them then", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={1492}, names={"Wharfmaster Dizzywig"}, text="Apothecary Helbrim. A crate for Ratchet; you deliver it later", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={848}, names={"Fungal Spores"}, text="Also Helbrim. You pick the spores up at the Forgotten Pools", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={869}, names={"Raptor Thieves"}, text="Gazrog", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.9, y=30.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={871}, names={"Disrupt the Attacks"}, text="Thork", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.9},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={842}, names={"Crossroads Conscription"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.0},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={844}, names={"Plainstrider Menace"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={870}, names={"The Forgotten Pools"}, text="Tonga Runetotem", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.9},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={871,1525}, obj={0,1}, names={"Disrupt the Attacks","Call of Fire"}, text="Razormane camp just north-east of the Crossroads: kill Water Seekers, Thornweavers and Hunters. The Water Seekers and Thornweavers also drop the Fire Tar for Call of Fire (you already have the Reagent Pouch). Pull one or two at a time and Earth Shock their casts. If no Fire Tar has dropped by the end, kill Razormane Geomancers on Thorn Hill just east until it does (keep clear of the rare elite Elder Mystic Razorsnout if he is up there)", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=55.3, y=25.8},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={844}, names={"Plainstrider Menace"}, text="Kill plainstriders all around the Crossroads for 7 Plainstrider Beaks. Any Sunscale raptor you meet also drops Raptor Heads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=53.1, y=28.6},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={871}, names={"Disrupt the Attacks"}, text="Thork", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={872}, names={"The Disruption Ends"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={5041}, names={"Supplies for the Crossroads"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.9},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={844}, names={"Plainstrider Menace"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={845}, names={"The Zhevra"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={855}, names={"Centaur Bracers"}, text="Regthar Deathgate, at the small camp west of the Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={850}, names={"Kolkar Leaders"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={870}, names={"The Forgotten Pools"}, text="Walk into the water at the Forgotten Pools, north of Regthar", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.1, y=22.5},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={848}, names={"Fungal Spores"}, text="Loot 4 Fungal Spores from the Laden Mushrooms around the pools", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.0, y=23.0},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={850}, names={"Kolkar Leaders"}, text="Barak Kodobane (16) is at the Kolkar camp west of the pools. Clear the centaurs around him first and fight him alone; drop Stoneclaw Totem if an add joins. Every Kolkar can drop Centaur Bracers: collect what you get, you finish them later", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=42.8, y=23.5},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={850}, names={"Kolkar Leaders"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={851}, names={"Verog the Dervish"}, text="Verog only shows up after many centaurs die around here (shared counter). Leave him for your next visit", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={870}, names={"The Forgotten Pools"}, text="Tonga Runetotem, back at the Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={877}, names={"The Stagnant Oasis"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.9},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={848}, names={"Fungal Spores"}, text="Apothecary Helbrim. Decline his next quest, Apothecary Zamah: it is timed, and you take it from him right before the Thunder Bluff trip in the next segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.1},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={845}, names={"The Zhevra"}, text="Kill Zhevra Runners south of the Crossroads for 4 Zhevra Hooves", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=36.6},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={819}, names={"Chen's Empty Keg"}, text="Chen's Empty Keg is a small keg on the ground. It spawns at a few spots: one is here by the road to Ratchet, another on the south-east shore of the Stagnant Oasis (56.5, 43.7), your next stop. Click it when you see it", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=54.7, y=37.2},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={877}, names={"The Stagnant Oasis"}, text="Stagnant Oasis: use the Dried Seeds at the bubbling fissure in the water. The Kolkar around the oasis also drop bracers; Earth Shock the Stormers' lightning. Rocklance, a level 17 rare elite centaur, walks a loop around this oasis: if you see him coming, move away and let him pass", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=55.6, y=42.8},
  {t="G", seg=4, text="Follow the road east to Ratchet on the coast", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.8, y=37.1},
  {t="F", seg=4, arg="Ratchet", text="Bragok, the flight master in the middle of Ratchet", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.1, y=37.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={894}, names={"Samophlange"}, text="Sputtervalve, right next to the flight master", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63, y=37.2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1492}, names={"Wharfmaster Dizzywig"}, text="Wharfmaster Dizzywig, by the dock", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.4, y=38.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={896}, names={"Miner's Fortune"}, text="Also Dizzywig. Leave Mebok Mizzyrix's raptor and spider quests: you take them on your first Ratchet visit in the next segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.3, y=38.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={819}, names={"Chen's Empty Keg"}, text="Brewmaster Drohn", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=38.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={821}, names={"Chen's Empty Keg"}, text="You collect the parts around the Crossroads and hand it in here at the end of this segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=38.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={887}, names={"Southsea Freebooters"}, text="Gazlowe", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.7, y=36.3},
