  {t="C", seg=4, q={888}, names={"Stolen Booty"}, text="Back to the pirate camp: loot the Shipment of Boots and the Telescopic Lens from the crates at the south end of the camp", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.1, y=49.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={888}, names={"Stolen Booty"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.7, y=36.3},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1525}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Telf Joolam is about 700 yards north of Ratchet, across the river in Durotar. Head north from Ratchet along the coast and cross the mouth of the Southfury River to the Durotar bank. A short way upriver, the same hidden trail as in segment 3 climbs the cliffs on your right up to Telf. He gives you the Fire Sapta", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=38.5, y=59.0},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={1526}, names={"Call of Fire"}, zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=38.6, y=59.0},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={1526}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Drink the Fire Sapta, then climb to the top of the shrine: the Minor Manifestation of Fire waits there and grows stronger the longer the fight lasts. Put down Stoneskin Totem and burst it with Earth Shock, Lightning Bolt and Rockbiter melee rather than fire spells. It drops the Glowing Ember. If you lose the sapta, Telf gives you another", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=38.7, y=58.3},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1526}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Click the Brazier of the Dormant Flame next to it to place the ember and light the torch", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=39.0, y=58.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={1527}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="The brazier gives you the Torch of the Eternal Flame for Kranal Fiss; you pass him on the north loop", zone="Durotar", map=1411, x=39.0, y=58.2},
  {t="G", seg=4, text="Back down the trail, across the river mouth and south to Ratchet", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.8, y=37.1},
  {t="FLY", seg=4, arg="Crossroads"},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={845}, names={"The Zhevra"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={903}, names={"Prowlers of the Barrens"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={877}, names={"The Stagnant Oasis"}, text="Tonga Runetotem", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={880}, names={"Altered Beings"}, text="Snapjaws live in the oases; you do this after the north loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.9},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={821,821}, obj={1,2}, names={"Chen's Empty Keg","Chen's Empty Keg"}, text="Around the Crossroads: Savannah Huntresses (lions) drop Savannah Lion Tusks and plainstriders drop Plainstrider Kidneys. Prowlers further north also drop tusks", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.4, y=26.7},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={872,5041}, names={"The Disruption Ends","Supplies for the Crossroads"}, text="Thorn Hill, north-east along the road: kill Razormane Geomancers and Defenders and Kreenig Snarlsnout on the hill. Pick up Crossroads' Supply Crates lying around the hill. Earth Shock the Geomancers' spells and fight them one at a time. Elder Mystic Razorsnout, a rare elite quilboar, can spawn on the hill: leave him alone", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=58.3, y=25.2, path={{53.8,24.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={924}, names={"The Demon Seed"}, text="Ak'Zeloth at Far Watch Post, north-east of Thorn Hill", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=20.1},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1527}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Kranal Fiss, west along the road from Far Watch. You get your Fire Totem and learn Searing Totem: drop it at the start of every hard pull from now on", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.0, y=19.9},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={869,903}, names={"Raptor Thieves","Prowlers of the Barrens"}, text="North towards the Sludge Fen: Sunscale Screechers drop Raptor Heads, Savannah Prowlers drop Prowler Claws", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=55.5, y=14.5},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={894}, names={"Samophlange"}, text="The Venture Co. research site in the Sludge Fen: use the Control Console", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.4, y=11.7},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={900}, names={"Samophlange"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.4, y=11.7},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={900}, names={"Samophlange"}, text="Shut off the three valves on the pipes around the console", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.3, y=11.5},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={900}, names={"Samophlange"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.4, y=11.7},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={901}, names={"Samophlange"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.4, y=11.7},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={901}, names={"Samophlange"}, text="Kill Tinkerer Sniggles in the hut near the console for the Console Key", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.8, y=10.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={901}, names={"Samophlange"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.4, y=11.6},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={902}, names={"Samophlange"}, text="Keep the Samophlange; you hand it in at Ratchet at the end of this segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.4, y=11.6},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={896}, names={"Miner's Fortune"}, text="Boulder Lode Mine, north-east of the Sludge Fen: kill Venture Co. Enforcers and Overseers until the Cats Eye Emerald drops. Takk the Leaper, a level 19 rare elite raptor, roams the ground between the fen and the mine: steer around him", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=60.8, y=4.0},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={858}, names={"Ignition"}, text="Wizzlecrank's Shredder, on the east side of the Sludge Fen", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.5, y=7.5},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={858}, names={"Ignition"}, text="Supervisor Lugwizzle (18) patrols the top of the nearby watch tower; he drops the Ignition Key. Searing Totem and Lightning Shield up, Healing Wave early", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.3, y=8.6},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={858}, names={"Ignition"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.5, y=7.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={863}, names={"The Escape"}, text="Escort quest: stay close to the shredder and kill the Venture Co. ambushers. Stoneclaw Totem pulls attackers off it. If it fails, take it again from the shredder", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.5, y=7.5},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={863}, names={"The Escape"}, text="The quest completes once the shredder is safe; you hand it in at Ratchet at the end of this segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=56.5, y=7.5},
  {t="H", seg=4, arg="Crossroads"},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={872,5041}, names={"The Disruption Ends","Supplies for the Crossroads"}, text="Thork", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.5, y=30.8},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={869}, names={"Raptor Thieves"}, text="Gazrog. Do not take Stolen Silver yet: you take it at the start of the next segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52, y=30.3},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={903}, names={"Prowlers of the Barrens"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn. Do not take Echeyakee yet: you take it at the start of the next segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={4921}, names={"Lost in Battle"}, text="Mankrik", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52, y=31.5},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={880}, names={"Altered Beings"}, text="Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads: kill Oasis Snapjaws for 8 Altered Snapjaw Shells. Kolkar Stormers here drop bracers too. Stay out of the big cave mouth in the hill just north of the oasis (Wailing Caverns): the Deviate mobs inside are elite. Gesharahan, a level 20 rare elite, can spawn in the oasis itself: leave him alone", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=46.8, y=39.6},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={4921}, names={"Lost in Battle"}, text="Follow the Gold Road south: Mankrik's wife lies at a burned-out camp near the road, among the quilboars", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=49.3, y=50.3},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={821}, obj={3}, names={"Chen's Empty Keg"}, text="Kill Stormsnouts (thunder lizards, level 18-19) around the body until a Thunder Lizard Horn drops. Pull one at a time with Searing and Stoneskin Totem down and heal before you drop low. If you cannot kill one, abandon Chen's Empty Keg now: no later step hands it in", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=47.0, y=51.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={4921}, names={"Lost in Battle"}, text="Back to Mankrik. He may then offer Her Name Is Olgra (new in Forever, Razormane Raiders around his wife's body): leave it for now; you take it from him in the next segment, after its first loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52, y=31.6},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={880}, names={"Altered Beings"}, text="Tonga Runetotem, next to Mankrik", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={3301}, names={"Mura Runetotem"}, text="Tonga. A delivery to Mura Runetotem at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest; keep it in your log until your first Eastern Kingdoms trip (segment 6)", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31.9},
  {t="FLY", seg=4, arg="Ratchet"},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={863,902}, names={"The Escape","Samophlange"}, text="Sputtervalve. Do not take his new quests yet (Wenikee Boltbucket, Ziz Fizziks): you take them on your next Ratchet visit", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.0, y=37.2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={896}, names={"Miner's Fortune"}, text="Wharfmaster Dizzywig, on the dock", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.3, y=38.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={821}, names={"Chen's Empty Keg"}, text="Brewmaster Drohn. Skip his next keg quest (level 24)", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=38.3},
  {t="FLY", seg=4, arg="Orgrimmar"},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={6384}, names={"Ride to Orgrimmar"}, text="Innkeeper Gryshka, at the inn in the Valley of Strength", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=54.1, y=68.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={6385}, names={"Doras the Wind Rider Master"}, text="Gryshka gives you a letter for Zargh", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=54.1, y=68.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={1061}, names={"The Spirits of Stonetalon"}, text="Zor Lonetree, outside Grommash Hold in the Valley of Wisdom. This is for Stonetalon in the next segment, just keep it", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=38.9, y=38.4},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=4, text="Orgrimmar, Valley of Wisdom (Kardris Dreamseeker, Sian'tsu or Sagorne Creststrider): learn your level 14 and 16 spells (new ranks of Lightning Bolt, Earth Shock and Stoneskin Totem at 14; Lightning Shield, Rockbiter and Cure Poison at 16)", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=38.8, y=36.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={5728}, names={"Hidden Enemies"}, text="Thrall in Grommash Hold. Only offered after the two earlier Hidden Enemies steps.", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=31.7, y=37.8, dg=1},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={6385}, names={"Doras the Wind Rider Master"}, text="Doras, the wind rider master on the tower in the Valley of Strength", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=45.1, y=63.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={6386}, names={"Return to the Crossroads."}, text="Doras", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=45.1, y=63.9},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={5761}, names={"Slaying the Beast"}, text="Neeru Fireblade in the Cleft of Shadow. Kill Taragaman the Hungerer and bring his heart.", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=49.5, y=50.6, dg=1},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Optional dungeon: Ragefire Chasm, levels 13-18", text="The entrance is in Orgrimmar, in the Cleft of Shadow. Inside: the corpse of Maur Grimtotem gives the follow-up quest Returning the Lost Satchel. Quests you picked up for it: Hidden Enemies, Slaying the Beast. Not on your path, only if you want the detour: The Power to Destroy... (Undercity 56, 92); Searching for the Lost Satchel (Thunder Bluff 70, 30); Testing an Enemy's Strength (Thunder Bluff 70, 30).", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=52.6, y=49.0, dg=1, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={5728}, names={"Hidden Enemies"}, zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=31.7, y=37.8, dg=1},
