  {t="A", seg=5, q={881}, names={"Echeyakee"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn. She gives you the Horn of Echeyakee", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={867}, names={"Harpy Raiders"}, text="Darsok Swiftdagger", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={3281}, names={"Stolen Silver"}, text="Gazrog. The silver lies in a raptor nest at the Raptor Grounds; you get it on loop 2", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.9, y=30.3},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={881}, names={"Echeyakee"}, text="Run north-east from the Crossroads to the giant kodo bones. Blow the Horn of Echeyakee there; the white lion comes to you. Kill it and loot its hide", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=55.6, y=17.2},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={867}, names={"Harpy Raiders"}, text="Witchwing harpies in the north-west Barrens drop the talons. Stay on the east side of the roost; the Slayers further west hit harder. Earth Shock the Windcallers' casts", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=40.5, y=16.5, path={{53.6,16.6},{52.2,19.9},{48.8,21.7},{46.2,25.0},{44.2,25.0},{41.8,21.4}}},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={851,855}, names={"Verog the Dervish","Centaur Bracers"}, text="Kolkar centaurs around Barak's old camp drop the bracers. Verog the Dervish appears after enough centaurs in the area die; he is level 18: open with Earth Shock, drop Stoneclaw Totem and heal with Healing Wave below half health", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=44.0, y=25.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={851,855}, names={"Verog the Dervish","Centaur Bracers"}, text="Regthar Deathgate, on the road west of the Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={852}, names={"Hezrul Bloodmark"}, text="Hezrul leads the Kolkar at Lushwater Oasis; he comes on the next loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={881}, names={"Echeyakee"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn, Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={905}, names={"The Angry Scytheclaws"}, text="The feathers drop from any Sunscale raptor; you will pass both raptor areas on the next loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={867}, names={"Harpy Raiders"}, text="Darsok Swiftdagger", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={875}, names={"Harpy Lieutenants"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={95774}, names={"Her Name Is Olgra"}, text="Mankrik (NEW). You collect the adornments next to his wife's body on the next loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.0, y=31.6},
  {t="FLY", seg=5, arg="Ratchet"},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={3921,1483}, names={"Wenikee Boltbucket","Ziz Fizziks"}, text="Sputtervalve: Wenikee is in the north Barrens, Ziz Fizziks is at Windshear Crag in Stonetalon", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63, y=37.2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={865,1069}, names={"Raptor Horns","Deepmoss Spider Eggs"}, text="Mebok Mizzyrix. The raptor horns come next; the spider eggs are in Stonetalon later in this segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.4, y=37.6},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={891}, names={"The Guns of Northwatch"}, text="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=39},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={865,3281}, names={"Raptor Horns","Stolen Silver"}, text="Raptor Grounds, south along the coast road: Sunscale Scytheclaws drop the horns and every Sunscale raptor can drop a feather for The Angry Scytheclaws (get 3). The Stolen Silver lies in a nest at 58.0, 53.9. If a second raptor joins, Stoneclaw Totem holds it off", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=57.0, y=53.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={891}, names={"The Guns of Northwatch"}, text="Northwatch Hold: Theramore Marines and Preservers drop the medals. Kill Captain Fairmount (61.9, 54.7), Cannoneer Whessan (60.4, 54.8) and Cannoneer Smythe (63.2, 56.6); they are 19-20, so clear the guards around each first. Pull one at a time, Earth Shock the Preservers' heals and Healing Wave between pulls", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=61.8, y=54.7},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={898}, names={"Free From the Hold"}, text="Gilthares Firebough is a prisoner inside the hold", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.0, y=55.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={898}, names={"Free From the Hold"}, text="Tell him you are ready and escort him north up the coast to Ratchet. Marines ambush on the way: drop Stoneclaw and Searing Totem and keep them on you, not on him. If he dies, take the quest from him again", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.0, y=55.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={891,898}, names={"The Guns of Northwatch","Free From the Hold"}, text="Captain Brightsun, Ratchet", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=39.1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={865}, names={"Raptor Horns"}, text="Mebok Mizzyrix", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.4, y=37.6},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={959}, names={"Trouble at the Docks"}, text="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz in Ratchet. The bottle is on Mad Magglish, a goblin in the cave before the dungeon portal.", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.1, y=37.6, dg=3},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={1491}, names={"Smart Drinks"}, text="Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet, after his Raptor Horns quest. Wailing Essence drops from the ectoplasms in and around the dungeon.", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.4, y=37.6, dg=3},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={905}, names={"The Angry Scytheclaws"}, text="Head west to the three Scytheclaw nests south-west of the Stagnant Oasis and use a feather on each", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.3, y=46.4},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={95774}, names={"Her Name Is Olgra"}, text="South-west to Mankrik's wife's body (49.3, 50.3): kill the quilboars around it (Mankrik calls them Razormane Raiders) until 4 Olgra's Adornments drop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=49.6, y=51.4},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={852}, names={"Hezrul Bloodmark"}, text="North to Lushwater Oasis: Hezrul Bloodmark (19) is at the Kolkar camp on the south bank. Clear the centaurs near him first and fight him alone", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=46.0, y=41.1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={852}, names={"Hezrul Bloodmark"}, text="Regthar Deathgate. He then offers Counterattack! (elite group quest): skip it", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4, path={{44.4,40.3},{42.6,30.1}}},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={875}, names={"Harpy Lieutenants"}, text="Back to the Witchwing roost: Witchwing Slayers drop the Harpy Lieutenant Rings", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=38.9, y=14.5},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={875}, names={"Harpy Lieutenants"}, text="Darsok Swiftdagger, Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9, path={{46.2,29.8}}},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={876}, names={"Serena Bloodfeather"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={905}, names={"The Angry Scytheclaws"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
