  {t="N", seg=5, arg="Optional dungeon: Wailing Caverns, levels 17-24", text="The entrance is the skull-shaped cave at the oasis south-west of the Crossroads; the portal is at the back of the cave. Nalpak and Ebru, in the small cave above the entrance, give Deviate Hides and Deviate Eradication. Leaders of the Fang needs a short chain first: Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads sends you to Hamuul Runetotem and then Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff. Inside: the last boss, Mutanus the Devourer, drops a Glowing Shard that starts a quest (show it to Sputtervalve in Ratchet, then take it to Falla Sagewind on top of the hill above the cave). Quests you picked up for it: Trouble at the Docks, Smart Drinks, Deviate Hides, Deviate Eradication. Not on your path, only if you want the detour: Leaders of the Fang (Thunder Bluff 76, 32); Serpentbloom (Thunder Bluff 23, 21).", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=46.0, y=36.5, dg=3, run=true},
