  {t="C", seg=6, q={1535}, names={"Call of Water"}, text="Walk to the pond just north-east of her hut and use the Empty Brown Waterskin at the water. Greater Thunderhawks, Stormhide thunder lizards and Hecklefang Stalkers (22-24) roam around it, and the Razormane camp just west of the hut has level 22-26 quilboars: stay away from the camp and Frost Shock anything that chases you.", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=44.3, y=76.8},
