  {t="C", seg=8, q={846,857}, names={"Revenge of Gann","The Tear of the Moons"}, text="Bael'dun Keep: soldiers, riflemen and officers drop the Nitroglycerin, Wood Pulp and Sodium Nitrate. The Tear of the Moons is in General Twinbraid's Strongbox inside the keep (49.1,84.2). General Twinbraid (level 30, five levels above you) stands right beside it and hits hard: clear the soldiers around him first, then pull him at full health and mana with Stoneclaw Totem down, Earth Shock and Healing Wave when low. If your shocks keep missing or he takes half your health in a few hits, drop Earthbind Totem and run, then abandon The Tear of the Moons and skip its turn-in. Loot the box once he is dead", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=49.1, y=84.2},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={857}, names={"The Tear of the Moons"}, text="Feegly. Skip this if you abandoned The Tear of the Moons", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=49.0, y=86.3},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={846}, names={"Revenge of Gann"}, text="Back north to Gann", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.9, y=77.0},
