  {t="C", seg=8, q={4821}, names={"Alien Egg"}, text="The Alien Egg sits in a cloud serpent den on the canyon floor around Freewind. It spawns at one of three spots (east around 56,50, south-east around 52,55 or south-west around 38,56). Cloud serpents (26-29) guard it: pull them off one at a time with Stoneclaw Totem down, then loot the egg", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=56.4, y=50.4},
