  {t="A", seg=8, q={4865}, names={"Serpent Wild"}, text="Hagar's follow-up: report to Motega Firemane at Whitereach Post in the far west. Jandia's two harpy quests in Freewind Post need level 27: you take them after Darkcloud Pinnacle", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=44.6, y=50.3},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={4767}, names={"Wind Rider"}, text="Highperch, at the far west end of Thousand Needles (leave the Screeching Canyon harpies for later): loot Highperch Wyvern Eggs from the nests. The wyverns (28-29) attack in pairs, so put Stoneclaw Totem down before you loot", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=12.3, y=36.1},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={1153}, names={"A New Ore Sample"}, text="Gravelsnout Diggers and Surveyors (kobolds) dig in the canyon north of Highperch (around 12,14-22); they drop the Unrefined Ore Sample. They are 28-30: pull one at a time. A few more wander east of Freewind (around 64,48)", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=12.2, y=18.0},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={4770}, names={"Homeward Bound"}, text="Pao'ka Swiftmountain, at Highperch", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=17.9, y=40.6},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={4770}, names={"Homeward Bound"}, text="Escort Pao'ka to Whitereach Post. You get attacked on the way: Stoneclaw Totem down, and heal Pao'ka too if he gets low. Redo it if he dies", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=17.9, y=40.6},
