  {t="C", seg=23, q={4971}, names={"A Matter of Time"}, text="Use the Temporal Displacer next to one of Andorhal's silos (the ones on the north-east edge of town are the safest) and kill the Temporal Parasites that appear. Andorhal has elites: Araj the Summoner (61) in the middle of town (about 45, 69), and Skeletal Warlords and Flesh Golems (56-57) on the streets. Pull the normal Scourge out to you and keep clear of the centre", zone="Western Plaguelands", map=1422, x=47.0, y=62.5},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={4971}, names={"A Matter of Time"}, text="Chromie", zone="Western Plaguelands", map=1422, x=39.5, y=66.8},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={4972}, names={"Counting Out Time"}, text="Chromie", zone="Western Plaguelands", map=1422, x=39.5, y=66.8},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={4972}, names={"Counting Out Time"}, text="Small Lockboxes lie in the rubble all over Andorhal; open them for the watches. Start with the ones on the west side near Chromie (38-42, 66-70), look down each street for the elite Warlords and Golems before you go in, and stay away from Araj in the middle", zone="Western Plaguelands", map=1422, x=40.0, y=67.5},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={4972}, names={"Counting Out Time"}, text="Chromie. Leave the repeatable version alone", zone="Western Plaguelands", map=1422, x=39.5, y=66.8},
