  {t="T", seg=23, q={4985}, names={"The Wildlife Suffers Too"}, text="Mulgris Deepriver, the Writhing Haunt. Skip Glyphed Oaken Branch: it goes to Thunder Bluff", zone="Western Plaguelands", map=1422, x=53.7, y=64.7},
  {t="G", seg=23, text="Ride east and cross the Thondroril River into the Eastern Plaguelands. Tirion Fordring's hut stands on the east bank of the river, a little to the north", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5542,5543,5544}, names={"Demon Dogs","Blood Tinged Skies","Carrion Grubbage"}, text="Tirion Fordring. Kill Plaguebats, Plaguehound Runts and Carrion Grubs whenever you pass them from here on", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5961}, names={"The Champion of the Banshee Queen"}, text="Nathanos Blightcaller at the Marris Stead, south-east of Tirion", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=22.2, y=63.5},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={6022,6042,6133}, names={"To Kill With Purpose","Un-Life's Little Annoyances","The Ranger Lord's Behest"}, text="Nathanos Blightcaller", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=22.2, y=63.5},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={6024}, names={"Hameya's Plea"}, text="A Torn Scroll by the Undercroft crypt, south of the Marris Stead. Infiltrator Hameya is in the far north-east", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=22.9, y=73.0},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5601}, names={"Sister Pamela"}, text="Pamela Redpath, in the ruined house in Darrowshire", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=31.1, y=78.0},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5149}, names={"Pamela's Doll"}, text="Pamela Redpath", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=31.1, y=78.0},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={5149}, names={"Pamela's Doll"}, text="The doll's head, left side and right side lie in the houses around Darrowshire. Put them together", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=33.5, y=78.5},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5149}, names={"Pamela's Doll"}, text="Pamela Redpath", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=31.1, y=78.0},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5241,5152}, names={"Uncle Carlin","Auntie Marlene"}, text="Pamela Redpath. Marlene is in the Western Plaguelands; you see her near the end of the segment", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=31.2, y=78.0},
  {t="G", seg=23, text="Ride east along the southern road to Light's Hope Chapel. Plaguehounds and Noxious Plaguebats on the way count", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=71.0, y=50.5},
  {t="F", seg=23, arg="Light's Hope Chapel", text="Georgia, the bat handler, just north-west of the chapel", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=70.5, y=47.5},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5241}, names={"Uncle Carlin"}, text="Carlin Redpath", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=71.7, y=50.0},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5211}, names={"Defenders of Darrowshire"}, text="Carlin Redpath", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=71.7, y=50.0},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={6030}, names={"Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff"}, text="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=71.6, y=50.1},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={8859}, names={"Secrets of the Colossus - Zora"}, text="Lord Maxwell Tyrosus, inside Light's Hope Chapel: hand him Zora's husk", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=71.9, y=48.4},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={6021}, names={"Zaeldarr the Outcast"}, text="Caretaker Alen", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=69.9, y=53.7},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5281}, names={"The Restless Souls"}, text="Caretaker Alen. You only have to find Egan, who stands outside by the Plaguewood termite mounds you visit anyway. Take just this first part: his follow-up is inside Stratholme", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=69.9, y=53.7},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={6022}, names={"To Kill With Purpose"}, text="Corin's Crossing, west of Light's Hope. Gather 7 Living Rot within 10 minutes and grind them with Nathanos' Mortar and Pestle. The Gibbering Ghouls here also count for Carlin: each one releases a Darrowshire Spirit when it dies, so talk to the spirit to free it. There are only 8 of them, so you finish the 15 spirits later in Plaguewood. The Scourge here stand in tight groups: Earth Shock the Dark Casters and Vile Tutors, and drop Stoneclaw Totem when a third mob joins", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=52.0, y=57.0},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={5544}, names={"Carrion Grubbage"}, text="Carrion Devourers in the north-east toward Northdale; the Carrion Grubs around Corin's Crossing also count. Diseased Flayers stand right next to them (around 57, 31) and release Darrowshire Spirits too", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=58.5, y=25.0, path={{54.6,57.0},{56.4,53.1},{56.4,49.0},{53.6,48.1},{52.6,45.1},{52.6,40.0},{55.0,36.4},{55.6,31.9},{58.8,26.8}}},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={6024}, names={"Hameya's Plea"}, text="Infiltrator Hameya, a lone troll in the far north. Take his key", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=62.0, y=11.1},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={6133}, names={"The Ranger Lord's Behest"}, text="Quel'Lithien Lodge, in the north: Rangers, Pathstriders and Woodsmen. The Quel'Thalas Registry is on a table inside the lodge. Pull them one at a time; Earthbind Totem stops the ones that try to run", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=45.5, y=12.5},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={5542,6042}, names={"Demon Dogs","Un-Life's Little Annoyances"}, text="Frenzied Plaguehounds in the north (around 52, 23) and the other hounds along the roads; Monstrous Plaguebats in the north (around 48, 35) and Noxious Plaguebats around Light's Hope", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=43.9, y=28.9},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={5901,5211}, names={"A Plague Upon Thee","Defenders of Darrowshire"}, text="Plaguewood, in the north-west: use the Empty Termite Jar on the Large Termite Mounds until you have 100 termites. The Cannibal Ghouls all over Plaguewood release Darrowshire Spirits: free the rest of your 15 here. Elite Ziggurat Protectors (58) guard the ziggurats (about 19, 16; 23, 29; 25, 18; 28, 18) and a Slaughterhouse Protector stands at about 27, 24: work the mounds on the west side (16-22, 19-27) and give them a wide berth", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=18.0, y=25.0},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5281}, names={"The Restless Souls"}, text="Egan, in Terrordale just west of the termite mounds. Don't take his follow-up (Stratholme)", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=11.4, y=26.6},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={6164}, names={"Augustus' Receipt Book"}, text="Augustus the Touched, in a cave at Terrordale, a few steps from Egan", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=11.4, y=26.4},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={6164}, names={"Augustus' Receipt Book"}, text="Augustus' Receipt Book lies in the ruined inn at Terrordale, a short walk north-east of his cave, upstairs. Crypt Fiends and Crypt Walkers (53-56) live in and around it: pull them one at a time", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=14.0, y=24.2},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={6164}, names={"Augustus' Receipt Book"}, text="Augustus the Touched", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=11.4, y=26.4},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={5543}, names={"Blood Tinged Skies"}, text="Plaguebats fly all over the west and south of the zone", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=14.3, y=64.1},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5542,5543,5544}, names={"Demon Dogs","Blood Tinged Skies","Carrion Grubbage"}, text="Tirion Fordring", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5742}, names={"Redemption"}, text="Tirion Fordring", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5742}, names={"Redemption"}, text="Listen to Tirion", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5781}, names={"Of Forgotten Memories"}, text="Tirion Fordring", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={5781,6021}, names={"Of Forgotten Memories","Zaeldarr the Outcast"}, text="The Undercroft, south of the Marris Stead: kill Zaeldarr the Outcast inside the crypt for his head. Taelan's Hammer drops from Mercutio Filthgorger, who is not there until you click the Loose Dirt Mound on Tirion Fordring's grave in front of the crypt (23.8, 74.5): he arrives with Crypt Robbers. Drop a Stoneclaw Totem, kill Mercutio first and Healing Wave between kills", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=23.5, y=74.0},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={6024}, names={"Hameya's Plea"}, text="Use Hameya's Key on the Mound of Dirt beside the wagon behind the crypt", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=23.6, y=73.8},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={6022,6042,6133}, names={"To Kill With Purpose","Un-Life's Little Annoyances","The Ranger Lord's Behest"}, text="Nathanos Blightcaller, Marris Stead. Skip his elite follow-ups", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=22.2, y=63.5},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5781}, names={"Of Forgotten Memories"}, text="Tirion Fordring", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5845}, names={"Of Lost Honor"}, text="Tirion Fordring", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=5.2, y=35.6},
  {t="C", seg=23, q={5845}, names={"Of Lost Honor"}, text="Northdale, in the north-east: the Symbol of Lost Honor lies in the hamlet", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=62.5, y=26.8},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={6021}, names={"Zaeldarr the Outcast"}, text="Caretaker Alen, Light's Hope Chapel", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=69.9, y=53.7},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5211}, names={"Defenders of Darrowshire"}, text="Carlin Redpath. Skip his elite follow-up", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=71.7, y=50.0},
  {t="H", seg=23, arg="Undercity", text="Hearthstone, or cast Astral Recall. Both on cooldown? Fly from Georgia at Light's Hope"},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5023}, names={"Better Late Than Never"}, text="Royal Overseer Bauhaus, near the guild registrar", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=69.8, y=43.2},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5049}, names={"The Jeremiah Blues"}, text="Royal Overseer Bauhaus", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=69.8, y=43.2},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5049}, names={"The Jeremiah Blues"}, text="Jeremiah Payson, the cockroach vendor close by", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=67.6, y=44.2},
  {t="A", seg=23, q={5050}, names={"Good Luck Charm"}, text="Jeremiah Payson", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=67.6, y=44.2},
  {t="N", seg=23, arg="Saved cloth? Ralston Farnsley in the Magic Quarter takes donations", text="60 wool, 60 silk, 60 mageweave and then 60 runecloth (7813, 7814, 7817, 7818). Every hand-in gives experience"},
  {t="N", seg=23, arg="Optional: Elemental Mastery (8410) and Spirit Totem (8412), about 8,900 XP", text="Only with Elemental Mastery in your log (from level 50 it comes only from Haromm in Stonard and the Orgrimmar and Thunder Bluff shaman trainers, so take it at the optional Stonard stop if you go there) and one each of Elemental Air, Fire, Earth and Water: buy what you lack at the Auction House here. Not doing it? Skip the three Bath'rah steps"},
  {t="N", seg=23, arg="Optional: fly to Tarren Mill and ride to Bath'rah the Windwatcher", text="From Tarren Mill ride east to the river and follow it north to the ruins where he stands. Hand in Elemental Mastery and take Spirit Totem, then go back to the Undercity with your hearthstone or Astral Recall, whichever is ready (or ride back and fly from Tarren Mill)", zone="Alterac Mountains", map=1416, x=80.5, y=66.9},
  {t="G", seg=23, text="Ride east to the Bulwark", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=83.1, y=68.9},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5236}, names={"Return to the Bulwark"}, text="Shadow Priestess Vandis", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=83.0, y=71.9},
  {t="N", seg=23, arg="Talk to High Executor Derrington, next to Vandis: accept Mission Accomplished! and hand it straight back (about 9,300 XP)", text="The quest's ID is mixed up between factions in the data (5237 / 5238), so this is a manual step; the logger records it"},
  {t="T", seg=23, q={5901}, names={"A Plague Upon Thee"}, text="Mickey Levine", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=83.3, y=72.3},
